<h2>1. The service</h2>
<p>A tool to automate and keep an eye on homes, stores and factories: devices, sensors, scenes, automations, notifications
   and dashboards.</p>
<h2>2. Responsibilities</h2>
<p>You are responsible for what you register and for the automations you turn on. Automation does not replace a security system,
   a certified alarm or machine safety equipment: use it as <strong>support</strong>, not as a guarantee.</p>
<h2>3. Acceptable use</h2>
<p>Do not use the service to control devices or places without permission from their owner.</p>
<h2>4. Closing your account</h2>
<p>You can delete your account at any time. The home's data is deleted when the last member leaves.</p>
